  "details": "the custom override template gives us the options to replace the default animations from f1 - f8 but using them all with custom animations, things dont end up well. 1 custom animation will activate on all keys and eventually stop after few toggles. there would be times where another custom animation will somehow activate and half the people in the lobby see it when others including myself dont. the only way to get around this bug is to use the f3, f5 and f7 keys. this has been an issue for a really long time and i hope it gets fixed soon.",
